hadiths[52]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1464","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1465","Malik said"
"1466","Malik related to me from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that a man in the time of Aban ibn Uthman's amirate freed all of his slaves and did not have other property than them. Aban ibn Uthman took charge of the slaves and they were divided into three groups. Then he drew lots on the basis that which ever group drew the dead man's arrow would be free. The arrow fell to one of the thirds"
"1467","Malik related to me that he heard Ibn Shihab say"
"1468","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1469","Malik related to me that he had heard that a slave-girl came to Umar ibn al-Khattab (who had been beaten by her master with a red hot iron) and he set her free. Malik said"
"1470","Malik related to me from Hilal ibn Usama from Ata ibn Yasar that Umar ibn al-Hakam said"
"1471","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud that one of the Ansar came to the Messenger of Allah"
"1472","Malik related to me that he had heard that al-Maqburi said that Abu Hurayra was asked whether a man who had to free a slave"
"1473","Malik related to me that he had heard that Fadala ibn Ubayd al- Ansari who was one of the companions of the Messenger of Allah"
"1474","Malik related to me that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Umar was asked whether a slave could be bought on the specific condition that it was to be used to fulfil the obligation of freeing a slave"
"1475","Malik related to me from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abi Amra al-Ansari that his mother had wanted to make a bequest"
"1476","Malik related to me that Yahya ibn Said said"
"1477","Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from A'isha"
"1478","Malik related to me from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar freed an illegitimate child and its mother"
"1479","Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"1480","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that A'isha umm al-muminin wanted to buy a slave-girl and set her free. Her people said"
"1481","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Amra bint Abd ar- Rahman that Barira came asking the help of A'isha"
"1482","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1483","Malik said that it was not permissible for a slave to buy himself from his master on the provision that he could give the wala' to whomever he wished as the wala' was for the one who set him free"
"1484","Malik related to me that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab was asked who had the wala' of the children whom a slave had by a free woman. Said said"
"1485","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm from Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Bakr ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn al- Harith ibn Hisham that his father told him that al-Asi ibn Hisham had died and left three sons"
"1486","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazm that his father told him that he was sitting with Aban ibn Uthman"
"1487","Malik related to me that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab spoke about a man who died and left three sons and left mawali whom he had freed. Then two of his sons died and left children. He said"
"1488","Malik related to me that he had asked Ibn Shihab about a slave who was released. He said"
"1564","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Said ibn al- Musayyab used to say"
"1565","Yahya related to me from Malik that he asked Ibn Shihab about the one-eyed man who gouged out the eye of a healthy person. Ibn Shihab said"
"1566","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Sulayman ibn Yasar that Zayd ibn Thabit used to say"
"1567","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard Sulayman ibn Yasar mention that a face wound in which the bone was bared was like a head wound in which the bone was bared"
"1568","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said"
"1569","Malik related to me"
"1570","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that Abdullah ibn az-Zubayr allowed retaliation for a head wound which splintered the bone"
"1571","ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman said"
"1572","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Muslim ibn Jundub from Aslam"
"1573","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1574","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab used to say"
"1575","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that Abu Ghatafan ibn Tarif al-Murri informed him that Marwan ibn al-Hakam sent him to Abdullah ibn Abbas to ask him what there was for the molar. Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"1576","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father made all the teeth the same in the blood-money and did not prefer any kind over others. Malik said"
"1577","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab and Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1578","Malik related to me that he had heard that Marwan ibn al-Hakam gave a decision about a slave who was injured that the person who injured him had to pay what he had diminished of the value of the slave. Malik said"
"1579","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz gave a decision that when a jew or christian was killed"
"1580","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1581","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said"
"1582","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"1584","Malik said that Ibn Shihab said"
"1585","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Umar ibn al- Khattab demanded of the people at Mina"
"1586","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Amr ibn Shuayb that a man of the Banu Mudlij called Qatada threw a sword at his son and it struck his thigh. The wound bled profusely and he died. Suraqa ibn Jusham came to Umar ibn al-Khattab and mentioned that to him Umar said to him"
"1587","Malik said that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab and Sulayman ibn Yasar were asked"
"1588","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr that a man of the Ansar called Uhayha ibn al-Julah had a young paternal uncle who was younger than him and who was living with his maternal uncles. Uhayha took him and killed him. His maternal uncles said"
"1589","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab and Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1590","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Umar ibn al-Khattab killed five or seven people for one man whom they had killed secretly by trickery. Umar said"
"1591","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Sad ibn Zurara that he had heard that Hafsa"